# Angelo's xarm_toolkit

Control a simulated Hiwonder xArm 1S (LeArm) robot arm with mouse clicks.
`xarm_toolkit` turns a click in a Pygame window into servo targets and sends
them to the ROS 2 (Jazzy) arm simulator, which runs in RViz with no physical
arm and no Gazebo.

> Built on top of the simulator in
> [prgrobots/hiwonder_xArm_1s](https://github.com/prgrobots/hiwonder_xArm_1s),
> which is itself based on [andrewda/learm_ros2](https://github.com/andrewda/learm_ros2).

