## Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Fix |
| ------- | --- |
| `No module named 'moveit_configs_utils'` | `sudo apt install ros-jazzy-moveit`, then rebuild |
| `package 'controller_manager' not found` | `sudo apt install ros-jazzy-ros2-control ros-jazzy-ros2-controllers`, then rebuild |
| `attempted relative import with no known parent package` | Don't run files inside `xarm_toolkit/` directly. Run `run_click.py` from the folder that contains `xarm_toolkit/`, or use `python -m xarm_toolkit.targets.mock_click` |
| `Could not reach the trajectory action server` | Start the simulator first; confirm `ros2 action list` shows the action; make sure both terminals share the same `ROS_DOMAIN_ID`. In a VM, try `export FASTDDS_BUILTIN_TRANSPORTS=UDPv4` in both terminals and restart the simulator |
| `externally-managed-environment` from pip | Activate the virtual environment before running `pip` |
| `undefined symbol ... Cdr9serializeEj` | Mismatched Fast CDR packages; see the "fixing the supplied VM" section of the [simulator README](https://github.com/prgrobots/hiwonder_xArm_1s) |
| `Overrun detected! The controller manager missed its desired rate` | Harmless in a VM; ignore |

